    "element_id": "4377fdcb9db7681516c547f1f947b574",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2024-017_Flow-Adjusting-Vavles_New-Nomenclature_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. Rep→news  \n\n  \n\n2024-12-12 | #017  \n\nStandardised nomenclature of Flow Adjusting Valves\n\nBeginning 2025 the Flow Adjusting Valves will be added to the DUNGS product program. Within this we decided to rework the nomenclature of the Flow Ajusting Valves. The aim of this new nomenclature is a simplification of the designation.",
