    "element_id": "79aee1e35a0599b71fcf893596ba66d4",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2024-017_Flow-Adjusting-Vavles_New-Nomenclature_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. The products will not undergo any technical changes, only the designation will be changed. The order numbers for the Flow Adjusting Valves won’t change either. The old designations, valid until 2024-12-31, and the new designations, valid from 2025-01-01, are shown in the table below.",
