  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "161f2183b2c85e1346f23afa21f5fa32",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2024-017_Flow-Adjusting-Vavles_New-Nomenclature_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. 0R0\n\n2/3\n\nRep→news  \n\n  \n\n2024-12-12 | #017  \n\nWe are now aligned to our standard nomenclature by using pressure and nominal size. Additionally we are adding what kind of thread is used (internal or external). This results in the following type code for the Flow Adjusting Valves from 2025:\n\nFAV 5 o YY | ZZ Flow Adjusting Valves — | 0 |I [ | | i EEEEEEE",
