    }
  },
  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "d5d7cf31c5562dc078e8536ce9d2d9c2",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2024-017_Flow-Adjusting-Vavles_New-Nomenclature_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. Due to different stock levels, there may be different designations for the Flow Adjusting Valves at the beginning of the transition period. DUNGS will deliver the products with the previous designation until the stock is used. As soon as the stocks are empty and newly produced items are delivered, these will contain the updated designation. Regardless of whether the old or new designation is on the product, the products are identical.",
